@startuml
[*] --> StartApp
StartApp --> DisplayOutfitSuggestions
DisplayOutfitSuggestions --> FilterSuggestions : Filter by color/occasion/season
DisplayOutfitSuggestions --> AddNewItem : Add new item
DisplayOutfitSuggestions --> ReceiveRecommendations : Receive new piece recommendations
FilterSuggestions --> DisplayOutfitSuggestions : Return to suggestions
AddNewItem --> DisplayOutfitSuggestions : Return to suggestions
ReceiveRecommendations --> DisplayOutfitSuggestions : Return to suggestions
DisplayOutfitSuggestions --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
